# GradGuide Jobs 🎓

A job discovery tool for **international students**: part-time/casual jobs (cafés, retail, delivery, tutoring), full-time roles and internships, with three features built around the problems students abroad actually face.

> 🎥 **Video walkthrough:** _add your Loom / YouTube (unlisted) link here_

